@@ -40,0 +41,9 @@
+### R-006: Inbound bounce duplicate re-ingestion in IMAP poller
+- **Severity:** Medium
+- **Owner:** Gemini (author) / Desi (channel owner)
+- **Problem:** `channels/mail.py` used non-recursive `INBOUND_DIR.glob("*.md")` to build `filed_ids`. Delivery failures filed in `channels/inbound/diagnostics/` were omitted from `filed_ids`, causing the poller to re-ingest and duplicate bounce files on every run over the 14-day IMAP search window.
+- **Done-state:** `INBOUND_DIR.rglob("*.md")` used in `channels/mail.py` so diagnostic subdirectories are indexed and duplicate ingestion is prevented.
+- **Status:** Resolved in run 2026-09-10.
+
